end":75},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o061b-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-ce0679352de1ebc43456","layer":"original","quote":"曹休使臧霸以轻船五百、敢死万人袭攻徐陵〖32〗，烧攻城车〖33〗，杀略数千人。将军全琮、徐盛追斩魏将尹卢〖34〗，杀获数百。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":300,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":23,"end":85},{"id":"wuzhu-q-o054","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-7e0fdf82962252602cbd","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年春正月〖1〗，陆逊部将军宋谦等〖2〗，攻蜀五屯；皆破之，斩其将。三月，鄱阳言黄龙现〖3〗。","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":293,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
